{"seq":1,"slug":"queue-bucketing","title":"队列与分桶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/matching/queue-bucketing","wordCount":1637,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"队列与分桶\">队列与分桶</h1><p>当十万人同时点下「开始对战」，匹配系统不可能对每个人去扫描其余九万九千多人——那是平方级的灾难。队列与分桶要解决的就是这个规模问题：把候选人组织进合适的数据结构，把搜索空间按评分预先切片，让「找一个评分相近的对手」从全局扫描退化成局部查找。这是匹配从理论走向能扛住真实流量的第一道工程关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>队列与分桶要解决的是匹配的规模问题：当候选人有十万量级，逐一全局扫描是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的灾难。分桶（bucketing）把连续的评分轴切成若干宽度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的区间，玩家按桶号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = \\lfloor R/w \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 落入对应桶，匹配时优先在同桶内找、不够再溢出到相邻桶，从而把「找评分相近的对手」从全局扫描退化成近常数级局部查找。桶宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是核心旋钮，本质是质量-等待曲线在空间维度上的离散化：窄桶均势但难凑齐，宽桶易凑齐但质量降。真实系统还会把延迟、地区、模式、平台一并作为分桶维度，但每多切一维就稀释一次候选池。桶给出候选集合后，撮合（match formation）按固定节拍批量跑，追求「足够好」而非全局最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"朴素队列为何不够\">朴素队列为何不够</h2><p>最直白的实现是把所有排队者塞进一个列表，每来一个人就遍历全表找最近的。问题立刻浮现：每次匹配是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，撮合一批是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在高峰期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 上万时彻底跑不动。更隐蔽的问题是它没有「等待」的概念——先来的人不该和后来的人享受同样的搜索宽容度。</p>\n<p>所以现代队列至少要承载两类信息：玩家的评分（决定和谁配），以及入队时间（决定该多宽容，这一点交给 <a href=\"constraint-relaxation\">约束放宽</a> 展开）。本篇聚焦前者——如何按评分把搜索空间切小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>单次匹配复杂度</th>\n<th>跨段灵活性</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局线性扫描</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极小池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定分桶</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 近似</td>\n<td>低（桶边界僵硬）</td>\n<td>大池、常见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有序结构（跳表/平衡树）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中大池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分桶 + 邻桶查找</td>\n<td>近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>工业主流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工业界主流是最后一种：先分桶把范围缩到常数级，再允许查询溢出到邻桶以保留灵活性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分桶-把评分轴切成段\">分桶：把评分轴切成段</h2><p>分桶（bucketing）是把连续的评分轴切成若干区间，每个区间一个桶，玩家按评分落入对应桶。匹配时优先在同桶内找人，找不够再看相邻桶。桶宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是关键参数：桶越窄，同桶内的人越均势（质量高），但每个桶里人越少（更难凑齐、更易久等）；桶越宽则相反。这其实是 <a href=\"../foundations/matchmaking-tradeoffs\">匹配质量与等待权衡</a> 在空间维度上的再现——桶宽就是把那条质量-等待曲线离散化的旋钮。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[新玩家入队&lt;br/&gt;评分 R] --&gt; B[计算桶号&lt;br/&gt;floor of R over w]&#10;  B --&gt; C[落入对应评分桶]&#10;  C --&gt; D{本桶人数&lt;br/&gt;够组一局?}&#10;  D -- 够 --&gt; E[同桶撮合, 质量最高]&#10;  D -- 不够 --&gt; F[向相邻桶溢出查找]&#10;  F --&gt; G{邻桶补足?}&#10;  G -- 是 --&gt; H[跨桶撮合, 质量略降]&#10;  G -- 否 --&gt; I[等待或继续放宽]\">graph TD\n  A[新玩家入队&lt;br/&gt;评分 R] --&gt; B[计算桶号&lt;br/&gt;floor of R over w]\n  B --&gt; C[落入对应评分桶]\n  C --&gt; D{本桶人数&lt;br/&gt;够组一局?}\n  D -- 够 --&gt; E[同桶撮合, 质量最高]\n  D -- 不够 --&gt; F[向相邻桶溢出查找]\n  F --&gt; G{邻桶补足?}\n  G -- 是 --&gt; H[跨桶撮合, 质量略降]\n  G -- 否 --&gt; I[等待或继续放宽]</pre><p>桶号的计算就是一个取整：桶号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = \\lfloor R / w \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>。把同桶玩家放进一个哈希表或环形缓冲，入队/出队都是近常数时间，撮合时只看本桶与少数邻桶，彻底避开了全局扫描。代价是桶边界的僵硬：评分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1499</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1499</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1499</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1501</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1501</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1501</span></span></span></span></span> 若被切进相邻桶，明明很近却要靠溢出才匹配——好的实现会用邻桶查找和软边界来缓和这一点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多维分桶-不只按评分切\">多维分桶：不只按评分切</h2><p>真实匹配很少只按一个维度切。延迟、地区、模式、平台都可能是分桶维度——一个低延迟优先的射击游戏会先按地区/数据中心分桶，再在桶内按评分细分。维度一多，每个细桶里的人就稀疏，凑齐一局变难，这又把压力推回等待。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分桶维度</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评分</td>\n<td>保证均势</td>\n<td>桶边界僵硬</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地区/数据中心</td>\n<td>压低延迟</td>\n<td>跨区玩家被切散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>游戏模式</td>\n<td>同模式才能凑局</td>\n<td>冷门模式池太小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台/输入设备</td>\n<td>公平（手柄 vs 键鼠）</td>\n<td>进一步稀释池子</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>维度越多越精细，但每多切一刀，候选池就被稀释一次。这解释了为什么冷门模式或小地区匹配总是慢——它们落在了一堆维度交叉后的稀疏细桶里。延迟为何值得单列一维、以及它与技能的优先级之争，已在 <a href=\"../foundations/matchmaking-goals\">匹配目标谱系</a> 里讨论过；这里只需知道：每个分桶维度都是一次池子稀释，必须为它的收益买单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"撮合-从候选到一局\">撮合：从候选到一局</h2><p>桶给出了候选集合，撮合（match formation）才是从集合里挑出具体一局的步骤。对一对一这很简单——取桶内评分最近的两人；对团队对局则要把若干人分成势均力敌的两队，这是个组合优化问题，属于 <a href=\"party-role-matching\">组队与角色匹配</a> 的范畴。一个常见的工程权衡是不追求全局最优撮合（太慢），而用贪心或局部搜索找「足够好」的一组，因为玩家对几秒延迟的敏感远超对一两分评分差的敏感。</p>\n<p>实现上，撮合通常按固定节拍（tick）批量跑：每隔几百毫秒扫一遍各桶，把能成的局成掉，成不了的留到下一拍并放宽门槛。这种批处理既摊薄了计算，又给了「等待积累池子」的天然窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>朴素全局扫描是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，高峰期跑不动；分桶把搜索缩到常数级是规模化的基础。</li>\n<li>桶宽是质量-等待曲线在空间上的离散化旋钮：窄桶均势但难凑齐，宽桶易凑齐但质量降。</li>\n<li>多维分桶（评分/地区/模式/平台）每多一维就稀释一次候选池，冷门组合因此匹配慢。</li>\n<li>撮合按固定节拍批量跑，追求「足够好」而非全局最优，并把成不了的局留待放宽。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>入队时间如何驱动随等待放宽门槛，见 <a href=\"constraint-relaxation\">约束放宽</a>。</li>\n<li>桶内如何把人分成势均力敌的两队，见 <a href=\"party-role-matching\">组队与角色匹配</a>。</li>\n<li>桶宽背后的质量-等待曲线，见 <a href=\"../foundations/matchmaking-tradeoffs\">匹配质量与等待权衡</a>。</li>\n<li>按地区/数据中心分桶之后的服务器分配，见 <a href=\"../../game-networking/mmo-architecture/server-cluster\">服务器集群</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"队列与分桶","id":"队列与分桶"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"朴素队列为何不够","id":"朴素队列为何不够"},{"level":2,"text":"分桶：把评分轴切成段","id":"分桶-把评分轴切成段"},{"level":2,"text":"多维分桶：不只按评分切","id":"多维分桶-不只按评分切"},{"level":2,"text":"撮合：从候选到一局","id":"撮合-从候选到一局"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"TrueSkill 与团队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/rating/trueskill-teams"},"next":{"title":"约束放宽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/matching/constraint-relaxation"}}